@host=localhost:8082

### Cria ticket valido sem destinatario: destinatario e o proprio criador
POST /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "instalar",
  "object": "computador",
  "details": "Instalar o computador para o novo usuario.",
  "creator": "ana@example.com",
  "observers": [
    "infra@example.com",
    "gestor@example.com"
  ]
}

### Cria ticket valido para outra pessoa
POST /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "configurar",
  "object": "email corporativo",
  "details": "Configurar a conta de email.",
  "creator": "solicitante@example.com",
  "recipient": "novo.usuario@example.com",
  "observers": []
}

### Invalido: sem acao
POST /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "object": "computador",
  "details": "Instalar o computador.",
  "creator": "ana@example.com"
}

### Invalido: observador nao e email
POST /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "instalar",
  "object": "computador",
  "details": "Instalar o computador.",
  "creator": "ana@example.com",
  "observers": [
    "email-invalido"
  ]
}

### Coloca ticket em andamento com responsavel
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "assignee": "tecnico@example.com"
}

### Invalido: em andamento sem responsavel
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Cancela ticket com motivo
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELED",
  "motivo": "Solicitacao duplicada"
}

### Invalido: motivo sem cancelar
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "RESOLVED",
  "motivo": "Tentativa invalida"
}

### Listar tickets
GET /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: application/json
